activity Prepare Solution
activity Heat Mixture
activity Add Catalyst
activity Monitor Reaction
activity Cool Solution
activity Filter Product
activity Dry Product
activity Analyze Sample
activity Store Product
activity Dispose Waste
bind Prepare Solution: Concentration, Solvent Type
bind Heat Mixture: Temperature, Reaction Time
bind Add Catalyst: Catalyst Type
bind Monitor Reaction: Reaction Status, Reaction Time
bind Analyze Sample: Purity, Yield
bind Store Product: Batch Number
Concentration: float between 0.1 and 10.0
Solvent Type: Water, Ethanol, Toluene
Temperature: float between 0.0 and 500.0
Reaction Time: integer between 1 and 600
Catalyst Type: Platinum, Palladium, Nickel, Iron
Reaction Status: Initiated, Ongoing, Completed, Failed
Purity: integer between 0 and 100
Yield: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Batch Number: integer between 1 and 1000
Init[Prepare Solution] | |
Precedence[Heat Mixture, Prepare Solution] | | |
Response[Heat Mixture, Add Catalyst] | | |
Co-Existence[Monitor Reaction, Add Catalyst] | | |1,10,m
Chain Response[Monitor Reaction, Cool Solution] | | |1,5,m
Precedence[Cool Solution, Filter Product] | | |1,2,h
Chain Succession[Filter Product, Dry Product] | | |
Response[Dry Product, Analyze Sample] | | |1,1,d
Alternate Response[Analyze Sample, Store Product] | | |
Precedence[Store Product, Dispose Waste] | | |
Response[Store Product, Dispose Waste] | | |1,1,h